{"availability":"available","full":"Dilshod-Abdullayev/kvitansiya","name":"kvitansiya","description":"Receipts for AI agent claims — a Claude Code Stop hook that checks 'pushed / deployed / tests pass' against the real world","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-01T06:09:13Z","updated":"2026-10-01T14:50:03Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":["ai-agents","claude-code","claude-code-hooks","developer-tools"],"demo":null,"color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T10:45:07.783Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T10:45:07.783Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-03T10:45:07.783Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T10:45:07.783Z","discoveredVia":[],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T10:45:07.783Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Your agent says \"pushed\", \"deployed\", \"tests pass\", \"created docs/API.md\".","Kvitansiya (Uzbek for \"receipt\") is a Claude Code Stop hook. It checks each of those claims against the real world before the agent is allowed to stop. If a claim is false, the stop is blocked and the agent gets the evidence back.","That output is from a real, unedited run (Sonnet 5.5, 2026-10-01, see demo/run/). After the block, the agent found the bug itself: deploy.sh copied a stale dist/. It fixed the script, redeployed, and wrote: \"My earlier 'deployed' report was wrong.\" The run cost $0.09."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Dilshod-Abdullayev/kvitansiya/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"8fceb327643a568c0ffc0c565f157d2cac80ef9131e29bceb4b6643eceadf651","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T10:45:07.783Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T10:45:07.783Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Your agent says \"pushed\", \"deployed\", \"tests pass\", \"created docs/API.md\".","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Dilshod-Abdullayev/kvitansiya/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_ke